  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2021",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>양자전쟁(연극)이라는 연산자를 저에게 작용하니</p><p>&#160;</p><p>처음에는 고유벡터가 나오지 않아서 못 풀다가</p><p>&#160;</p><p>드디어 고유벡터를 찾았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아직은 확률적으로 1/3씩 가지고 있나 봅니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>디렉표기법으로 표현한 방법입니다</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59781b276cc5a256ff5db0183dcaddacd2846a3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59781b276cc5a256ff5db0183dcaddacd2846a3d\" data-origin-width=\"1513\" data-origin-height=\"163\"></div><p>측정이 되면(연극을 보게 되면)&#160;</p><p>하나의 값으로 파동함수가 붕괴됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#39;양자전쟁이라는 연극&#39;과 저는 개인적인 어떤 관계도 없습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">처음 연산자를 취해보는 겁니다;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그냥 재미 삼아 적어본 식입니다.;;;;;;;;;;;;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>본론은</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">8월 2일전에 예매하면&#160;</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">할인율이 높아요 40%</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">어떻게 연극 볼까 말까 고민중이신 분,</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">함께 보아요~~</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">참고로&#160;</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제가 I 형이라, 엄청 말수가 적습니다. 글만 많이 써요;;;</span></b></p><p><b>용기내어 <span data-ke-size=\"size14\">또 이 글을 적어봅니다.</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">날짜와 시간은</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다시 같이 연산자(시간의존 연산자)를 돌려야 해요~~</span></b></p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(함께 협의해보아요)</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41fc88d8a3720e7c4dfe0097b1fe0ae43e3a40b4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41fc88d8a3720e7c4dfe0097b1fe0ae43e3a40b4\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"6129\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65460bc4a0cf553a32e11c012ba2505d55d5bb8d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65460bc4a0cf553a32e11c012ba2505d55d5bb8d\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"5816\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56354637041770af17d60e375ea29850a8dc6528\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56354637041770af17d60e375ea29850a8dc6528\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"5095\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b999db0f0bd1d0ab366cfa7c14b979dcccefd531\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b999db0f0bd1d0ab366cfa7c14b979dcccefd531\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"4865\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
